#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:31
msgid "Your community is publicly accessible and shows up in search results."
msgstr ""
"Su comunidad es de acceso público y se muestra en los resultados de "
"búsqueda."

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:38
msgid "Your community is restricted to users with access."
msgstr "Su comunidad está restringida a usuarios con acceso."

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:48
msgid ""
"Members who have set their visibility to public are visible to anyone. "
"Members with hidden visibility are only visible to other members."
msgstr ""
"Los miembros que han configurado su visibilidad como pública son visibles "
"para cualquiera. Los miembros con visibilidad oculta solo son visibles para "
"otros miembros. "

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:53
msgid "Members-only"
msgstr ""

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:57
msgid ""
"Members in your community are only visible to other members of the "
"community."
msgstr ""
"Los miembros de tu comunidad solo son visibles para otros miembros de la "
"comunidad"

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:69
msgid ""
"All authenticated users can submit records to the community. If the "
"community is restricted, then only members can submit records to it."
msgstr ""

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:77
msgid "Only members can submit records to the community."
msgstr ""

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:83
msgid "Review all submissions"
msgstr ""

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:86
msgid "All submissions to the community must be reviewed."
msgstr "Todas las presentaciones a la comunidad deben ser revisadas."

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:89
msgid "Allow curators, managers and owners to publish without review"
msgstr ""

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:93
msgid ""
"Submissions to the community by default requires review, but curators, "
"managers and owners can publish directly without review."
msgstr ""
"Las presentaciones a la comunidad requieren revisión por defecto, pero los "
"curadores, gestores y propietarios pueden publicar directamente sin "
"revisión."

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:97
msgid "Allow all members to publish without review"
msgstr ""

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:101
msgid ""
"Submissions to the community by default requires review, but all community "
"members can publish directly without review."
msgstr ""
"Las presentaciones a la comunidad requieren revisión por defecto, pero todos"
" los miembros de la comunidad pueden publicar directamente sin revisión."

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:111
msgid "Users can request to join your community."
msgstr "Los usuarios pueden solicitar unirse a tu comunidad."

#: invenio_communities/views/communities.py:118
msgid ""
"Users cannot request to join your community. Only invited users can become "
"members of your community."
msgstr ""
"Los usuarios no pueden solicitar unirse a tu comunidad. Solo los usuarios "
"invitados pueden convertirse en miembros de tu comunidad. "
